       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. STRINGLENGTH.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SOURCE-STR PIC X(20) VALUE "hello world".
       01 LEN PIC 9(3).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE LEN = FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(SOURCE-STR))
           DISPLAY "LENGTH: " LEN
           STOP RUN.
